# Opus Quad fixture: rekordbox-lighting-request
# Quoted bytes, not a capture: the type-0x11 packet rekordbox lighting sends
# to port 50002 so the Opus Quad starts sending status packets, as published
# by two independent implementations:
#   https://github.com/Deep-Symmetry/beat-link/blob/main/src/main/java/org/deepsymmetry/beatlink/VirtualRekordbox.java
#     (array `rekordboxLightingRequestStatusBytes`, the template before
#     beat-link patches its MAC and IP over bytes 0x26-0x2f)
#   https://github.com/kyleawayan/opus-quad-pro-dj-link-analysis/blob/main/pro-dj-link.js
#     (`sendCdj()` with the computer name "macbook pro", which yields these bytes)
# Documented in: docs/protocols/opus-quad.md#the-lighting-request-0x11
# Device 0x17, computer name "macbook pro" one byte per UTF-16BE code unit
# from byte 0x28, 0x128 (296) bytes in all.
# Bytes: UDP payload, hex, 16 per line.
51 73 70 74 31 57 6d 4a 4f 4c 11 72 65 6b 6f 72
64 62 6f 78 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01
01 17 01 04 17 01 00 00 00 6d 00 61 00 63 00 62
00 6f 00 6f 00 6b 00 20 00 70 00 72 00 6f 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
